"He'd gone out for 12 years."

1794
01:43:08.208 --> 01:43:10.128
"He brought back a Harley."

1795
01:43:10.208 --> 01:43:13.587
Smile, please. - "It will be fun when rocking
the dance floor is the whole family."

1796
